  "description": "Persistent memory for Claude Code. Also: loop detection, scope guards, code analysis, and a local LLM for second opinions. Claude Code forgets everything between sessions and after context compaction. Mini Claude provides: - Checkpoints - Save task state, auto-restore after compaction - Mistake memory - Log errors, get warned next time you touch that file - Decision memory - Log WHY you chose some",
